OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped horses on A3 prompt road
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FHorses loose on the A3 prompted a
OL,7,Ftemporary road closure in Surrey,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FA Surrey Police spokesperson said
OL,11,Fofficers were called to reports of
OL,12,Fhorses on the southbound carriageway of
OL,13,Fthe A3 at Wisley, near Portsmouth Road,
OL,14,Fat about 07:35 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe animals had escaped from a nearby
OL,17,Ffield, forcing the road to close while
OL,18,Fthey were safely moved to a nearby
OL,19,Fservice station.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
